:02.402><c>formula  </c><00:00:02.406><c>must </c><00:00:02.410><c>also </c><00:00:02.414><c>be </c><00:00:02.418><c>true </c><00:00:02.422><c>when </c><00:00:02.426><c>we </c><00:00:02.430><c>interchange  </c><00:00:02.434><c>the </c><00:00:02.438><c>role  </c><00:00:02.442><c>of </c><00:00:02.446><c>x </c><00:00:02.450><c>and </c><00:00:02.454><c>y </c><00:00:02.458><c>so </c><00:00:02.462><c>algebraically </c><00:00:02.466><c>everything  </c><00:00:02.470><c>is </c><00:00:02.474><c>similar </c><00:00:02.478><c>to </c><00:00:02.482><c>what </c><00:00:02.486><c>we </c><00:00:02.490><c>have </c><00:00:02.494><c>seen </c><00:00:02.498><c>for </c><00:00:02.502><c>the  </c><00:00:02.506><c>case </c><00:00:02.510><c>of </c><00:00:02.514><c>discrete </c><00:00:02.518><c>random </c><00:00:02.522><c>variables </c><00:00:02.526><c>it's  </c><00:00:02.530><c>the </c><00:00:02.534><c>same </c><00:00:02.538><c>form </c><00:00:02.542><c>of </c><00:00:02.546><c>the </c><00:00:02.550><c>multiplication </c><00:00:02.554><c>rule  </c><00:00:02.558><c>although </c><00:00:02.562><c>the </c><00:00:02.566><c>interpretation </c><00:00:02.570><c>is </c><00:00:02.574><c>a </c><00:00:02.578><c>bit  </c><00:00:02.582><c>different </c><00:00:02.586><c>because </c><00:00:02.590><c>densities </c><00:00:02.594><c>are </c><00:00:02.598><c>not  </c><00:00:02.602><c>probabilities</c>

